faq:
  - q: How do we keep stock accurate across branches?
    a: Create a warehouse for each location and move stock with transfers. Each transfer records a movement out and a movement in, so both sides stay accurate.
  - q: Can we see what was issued to a project?
    a: Yes. Issues and returns are recorded against the project, so the material that went into a job is visible.
  - q: Can we hold stock for a job before issuing it?
    a: Yes. Reservations reduce available quantity so another job cannot take the same items.
  - q: Does damaged stock get recorded?
    a: Yes. Damage and loss are recorded as movements with a reason.
